  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Partnership with United States Agency for International Development towards support to Devolution. Focus is on 8 counties: covers improved planning/budgeting; public financial management (including revenue); performance management; anti-corruption. is a component of Kenya Devolution Support Programme reported by FCDO with a funding type of 112 - Other bilateral donor and a budget of &#xa3;1,614,000. It works in the following sector(s): Decentralisation and support to subnational government, Public finance management (PFM).</narrative>
  </description>
